# SERV → code gate → AgentKit

Order is mandatory:

1. SERV model with Multipath (`*-serv-multipath`) + structured ALLOW/DENY schema
2. Tools: `serv_shadow_agent` (hint = policy caps/allowlist/abstain) + `serv_prompt_guard`
3. Validate JSON in app; invalid/refuse → DENY
4. Deterministic code gate: max amount, allowlist, idempotency
5. Only then AgentKit transfer on Base Sepolia
6. Persist receipt (prompt version, shadow, tokens, latency, cost, rule, tx)

Base URL: `https://inference-api.openserv.ai/v1`. System prompt required.
